WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.020 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 29]

01:52.800 --> 01:53.780
Perhaps the scar of war

01:54.510 --> 01:56.530
will disappear

01:56.920 --> 01:58.420
when the leaves

01:58.870 --> 02:00.210
of Yellow Maple Valley turn red.

02:02.000 --> 02:03.690
Where is his cavern?

02:04.600 --> 02:06.260
I should ask around.

02:20.280 --> 02:21.370
What do I want?

02:22.280 --> 02:23.940
I've always wanted the same thing.

02:26.390 --> 02:27.330
Don't you know?

02:31.320 --> 02:32.220
Hongfu.

02:43.480 --> 02:44.410
When Huayuan

02:44.790 --> 02:46.050
was a new disciple,

02:46.710 --> 02:48.740
we often gazed at the snow mountain here.

02:49.760 --> 02:51.570
He was a nostalgic person.

02:52.480 --> 02:53.330
I'm sure

02:54.430 --> 02:55.460
he is glad

02:55.560 --> 02:56.570
to return to this place.

02:57.920 --> 02:59.210
We promised

03:01.200 --> 03:03.180
to return and gaze upon the same view.

03:04.560 --> 03:05.460
Little do I know,

03:07.200 --> 03:09.930
this is how I send him off.

03:21.120 --> 03:23.570
One less drinking friend.

03:37.430 --> 03:38.850
Moonshadow Sect's Immortal Stupor

03:39.430 --> 03:41.050
was his favorite liquor.

03:43.350 --> 03:44.890
What is your plan now?

03:45.470 --> 03:47.060
I heard everyone from the Yellow Maple Valley

03:47.280 --> 03:48.340
went to the Nine Kingdoms Alliance.

03:49.800 --> 03:51.410
I am just a rogue cultivator now.

03:51.750 --> 03:52.610
Be it the demonic sects

03:53.280 --> 03:54.450
or Yellow Maple Valley,

03:54.960 --> 03:56.980
my past no longer has anything to do with me.

03:58.280 --> 03:59.290
However,

03:59.430 --> 04:00.690
I promised Huayuan

04:01.430 --> 04:02.540
to look after

04:03.400 --> 04:04.610
his disciples.

04:07.030 --> 04:08.890
Especially his favorite, the youngest one.

04:09.080 --> 04:10.260
He's gone missing.

04:11.960 --> 04:13.010
That young man

04:13.960 --> 04:15.890
who goes by the name of Han?

04:16.310 --> 04:17.170
Han Li.

04:18.280 --> 04:19.690
Have you met him before?

04:22.080 --> 04:22.690
Yes.

04:23.470 --> 04:24.500
He

04:25.150 --> 04:26.780
looks unassuming,

04:27.150 --> 04:28.220
yet

04:28.680 --> 04:29.980
he is quite smart.

04:30.710 --> 04:32.380
So he caught my attention.

04:32.840 --> 04:34.100
Your description

04:34.360 --> 04:35.410
is apt.

04:36.310 --> 04:38.060
Despite his plain talent,

04:38.430 --> 04:40.290
he stands out

04:40.750 --> 04:42.010
and is often favored by fortune.

04:42.870 --> 04:44.780
Xuan'er went to the Yan Clan Stronghold with him.

04:45.190 --> 04:47.060
And she missed him a lot when she returned.

04:47.470 --> 04:48.570
I thought that

04:49.150 --> 04:50.540
would become her inner demon.

04:50.910 --> 04:51.780
I see.

04:53.310 --> 04:54.850
You can't judge a book by its cover.

04:56.870 --> 04:59.100
It's just a story between the younglings.

04:59.710 --> 05:00.850
There's no point

05:01.000 --> 05:02.130
talking about this now anyway.

05:02.870 --> 05:03.570
I can only hope

05:03.800 --> 05:05.100
he manages to escape

05:05.910 --> 05:07.410
like he usually does.

05:12.240 --> 05:13.850
If that is Huayuan's last wish,

05:14.680 --> 05:15.450
I

05:15.630 --> 05:16.940
can help you find him.

05:17.430 --> 05:18.380
I wouldn't want

05:18.520 --> 05:19.690
to bother you with a small matter.

05:20.470 --> 05:21.100
Besides,

05:21.360 --> 05:22.380
I plan to find them

05:22.840 --> 05:24.290
after I take care

05:24.590 --> 05:25.660
of everything here.

05:26.310 --> 05:27.570
It's fine.

05:29.240 --> 05:30.380
Moonshadow Sect

05:30.960 --> 05:32.220
is negotiating peace with the demonic sects.

05:32.840 --> 05:34.450
I have nothing to do as well.

05:35.240 --> 05:36.290
In that case,

05:37.280 --> 05:38.130
thank you.

05:40.560 --> 05:41.170
Hongfu.

05:41.310 --> 05:42.060
I'll take my leave.

05:52.120 --> 05:53.220
Huayuan,

05:53.750 --> 05:54.660
don't worry.

05:56.190 --> 05:57.660
We'll find them.

06:00.140 --> 06:04.340
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

06:06.100 --> 06:10.460
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

06:11.980 --> 06:14.860
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

06:15.500 --> 06:17.700
♪Old scenes rise again♪

06:18.980 --> 06:24.820
♪Too hard to forget, easier just to miss♪

06:26.820 --> 06:31.180
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

06:33.060 --> 06:37.300
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

06:39.100 --> 06:41.620
♪This noisy world, this lonely page...♪

06:43.120 --> 06:43.810
Come.

06:44.510 --> 06:45.580
Take this.

06:45.620 --> 06:51.580
♪Eyes once looked far, now lost in the shift♪

06:52.700 --> 06:57.660
♪Autumn winds stir, smoke curls once more♪

06:59.180 --> 07:03.740
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky returning to my eyes♪

07:05.940 --> 07:10.420
♪Looking back from the mountaintop, time lost its name♪

07:12.460 --> 07:17.980
♪Was it yesterday or tomorrow?♪

07:19.620 --> 07:24.100
♪The world has changed beyond recall...♪

07:25.750 --> 07:26.490
Han.

07:27.830 --> 07:28.580
It's me.

07:28.580 --> 07:30.300
♪All the words ever spoken...♪

07:30.920 --> 07:31.540
Han.

07:32.040 --> 07:32.780
You're awake.

07:35.460 --> 07:40.780
♪Crossing centuries and days...♪

07:42.480 --> 07:43.180
Careful.

07:47.950 --> 07:48.900
Senior Song.

07:49.350 --> 07:50.420
Senior Zhong.

07:51.240 --> 07:52.170
How come you are here?

07:55.430 --> 07:56.290
Wait.

07:56.630 --> 07:57.370
I brought some water

07:58.040 --> 07:58.980
from the valley.

07:59.310 --> 08:00.100
Have some.

08:09.390 --> 08:09.730
Who

08:09.950 --> 08:10.930
is this big guy?

08:11.750 --> 08:12.780
He stands beside you

08:13.070 --> 08:14.050
silently

08:14.390 --> 08:15.250
for two days.

08:15.830 --> 08:17.140
He looks scary.

08:18.720 --> 08:19.580
He's a friend of mine.

08:20.310 --> 08:21.250
I have some pills.

08:21.950 --> 08:22.660
Take some.

08:39.510 --> 08:40.170
Weren't you

08:41.160 --> 08:42.410
at Golden Drum Plains?

08:58.000 --> 08:59.220
The Seven Sects

09:00.680 --> 09:02.020
lost in the war after all.

09:04.510 --> 09:05.140
Yes.

09:06.870 --> 09:08.140
We were betrayed

09:08.830 --> 09:09.730
and defeated.

09:11.560 --> 09:12.290
Spirit Beast Mountain

09:13.390 --> 09:14.460
and Skyfort Castle.

09:15.310 --> 09:16.540
Those traitors...

09:17.390 --> 09:18.410
One day,

09:19.240 --> 09:20.900
I'll make them pay.

09:21.950 --> 09:22.930
You are still hurt.

09:23.560 --> 09:24.410
No point in acting tough.

09:25.270 --> 09:27.050
Now that our sect has fallen

09:28.480 --> 09:30.250
and the demonic sects are hunting us,

09:31.870 --> 09:33.460
we need to find a way to survive.

09:35.510 --> 09:36.290
Our sect

09:37.000 --> 09:37.980
has fallen?

09:41.190 --> 09:42.580
What about Master and other mentors?

09:44.480 --> 09:45.660
When I was fleeing,

09:46.630 --> 09:48.460
they were fighting the demonic sects.

09:49.480 --> 09:50.370
What happened to them?

09:56.430 --> 09:58.140
We just learned

09:59.000 --> 10:00.100
that Master

10:01.430 --> 10:03.050
fought Yunlu

10:04.600 --> 10:06.100
to defend our sect.

10:07.720 --> 10:09.010
He sacrificed his Golden Core

10:13.480 --> 10:14.490
and passed away.

10:32.790 --> 10:33.730
How could this be?

10:42.360 --> 10:43.300
Master...

10:57.720 --> 10:58.700
He already

11:00.360 --> 11:02.460
made the decision to die

11:04.910 --> 11:06.180
when he went to Mentor Hongfu's side.

11:15.960 --> 11:17.010
Perhaps this is what

11:17.510 --> 11:19.100
Master wanted, to make peace

11:20.320 --> 11:21.370
with himself.

11:24.080 --> 11:25.100
And now,

11:27.390 --> 11:28.610
we're truly

11:29.200 --> 11:30.220
disciples

11:30.480 --> 11:31.340
without a home.

11:42.630 --> 11:43.340
Senior Song,

11:44.480 --> 11:46.060
Master asked me to keep this

11:46.670 --> 11:48.250
and give it to you if I saw you.

11:49.360 --> 11:50.130
Consider

11:51.240 --> 11:52.460
it delivered.

11:53.030 --> 11:53.610
Han,

11:54.320 --> 11:55.770
Master surely

11:56.240 --> 11:57.650
left some for you too.

11:58.360 --> 11:59.770
I already took mine.

12:01.080 --> 12:02.010
The rest

12:02.240 --> 12:03.610
is just some gems and pills.

12:05.600 --> 12:06.580
You need them

12:08.440 --> 12:09.610
more than I do wherever you go.

12:16.100 --> 12:18.320
[Li]

12:18.320 --> 12:19.010
He

12:20.120 --> 12:21.890
embroidered this word the year I achieved

12:24.030 --> 12:25.060
the Foundation Establishment Stage.

12:29.630 --> 12:31.530
He kept it by his side

12:32.360 --> 12:33.180
as if it were his treasure.

12:43.440 --> 12:44.460
I also have

12:45.000 --> 12:46.530
some pills that I made.

12:47.200 --> 12:48.250
Take them.

12:48.630 --> 12:49.220
Here you go.

12:51.440 --> 12:53.300
You won't join us to regroup with others?

12:53.630 --> 12:54.770
We can retaliate

12:55.080 --> 12:56.300
and fight those scums.

13:10.960 --> 13:12.300
The last thing Master did

13:12.720 --> 13:13.940
before he left

13:15.630 --> 13:17.940
was to remove the Soul-Burning Spell on me.

13:21.960 --> 13:23.010
Thinking back,

13:23.790 --> 13:24.890
the demonic sects

13:25.600 --> 13:26.490
knew

13:26.870 --> 13:28.700
precisely where we were.

13:31.030 --> 13:32.700
Master didn't say anything,

13:34.000 --> 13:34.980
but I understood why now.

13:35.960 --> 13:36.730
Were we

13:38.720 --> 13:40.180
betrayed by the sect?

13:44.030 --> 13:45.300
Exactly.

13:53.080 --> 13:55.370
I feel bad for our peers.

13:56.960 --> 13:58.300
They didn't even know

13:59.630 --> 14:01.460
they were bait till the very end.

14:07.600 --> 14:08.490
Perhaps

14:09.510 --> 14:11.940
this is how the world works.

14:13.870 --> 14:15.250
But we are currently powerless

14:16.080 --> 14:17.420
to change it.

14:24.870 --> 14:25.940
And I

14:27.320 --> 14:29.340
don't want to be bait anymore.

14:31.030 --> 14:31.980
It's time

14:33.390 --> 14:34.650
to live differently.

14:50.510 --> 14:51.610
If we live,

14:53.910 --> 14:54.940
there is hope.

15:02.630 --> 15:03.370
Han,

15:04.480 --> 15:05.650
now that you've explained everything,

15:06.320 --> 15:07.610
I don't want to regroup with them anymore.

15:09.390 --> 15:10.100
Weiniang.

15:10.320 --> 15:11.060
What about you?

15:14.000 --> 15:15.730
Let's turn to Mentor Hongfu

15:16.670 --> 15:17.940
and see what she plans to do.

15:21.480 --> 15:22.100
Han.

15:22.720 --> 15:24.100
You've always been a free soul.

15:24.480 --> 15:25.610
Go wherever

15:26.080 --> 15:27.010
you want.

15:29.750 --> 15:31.180
Yellow Maple Valley may be gone.

15:32.240 --> 15:33.220
But we're still here.

15:38.720 --> 15:40.100
If possible,

15:40.720 --> 15:41.850
let's meet again.

15:54.080 --> 15:55.060
Seniors,

15:55.320 --> 15:56.180
farewell.

15:56.670 --> 15:57.730
Han Li.

15:58.630 --> 15:59.460
Farewell.

16:00.910 --> 16:01.580
Farewell.

17:22.510 --> 17:23.460
Reunion is rare.

17:24.080 --> 17:24.980
Departure is bitter.

17:25.510 --> 17:26.650
Every regret

17:27.150 --> 17:28.340
is unique.

17:29.390 --> 17:30.650
I can't stop here.

17:31.840 --> 17:32.890
My mentors

17:33.510 --> 17:35.130
told me to explore the world outside.

17:35.670 --> 17:37.180
I'll fix the teleport array first.

17:38.320 --> 17:39.460
I wonder if Yunxiao

17:39.840 --> 17:41.180
and the rest are ready.

17:47.780 --> 17:49.090
[In Memory of Qi Yunxiao]
Qi is...

17:54.030 --> 17:55.300
I'm too late.

18:00.870 --> 18:01.700
Miss Ruyin.

18:07.150 --> 18:08.060
Her Dragon Roar Body

18:08.670 --> 18:09.490
is ferocious.

18:22.790 --> 18:23.770
This cask

18:24.120 --> 18:25.580
contains the Yunxiao Heart Technique

18:25.750 --> 18:26.610
you've seen.

18:27.030 --> 18:27.700
My husband

18:28.120 --> 18:30.180
has removed all the restriction spells.

18:30.550 --> 18:31.420
And the other one

18:32.080 --> 18:34.460
contains all my understandings of the array

18:35.120 --> 18:35.980
as well as

18:36.240 --> 18:38.580
rare array scrolls you won't find on the market.

18:39.320 --> 18:40.380
Please

18:41.200 --> 18:42.660
accept them.

18:46.590 --> 18:47.530
I can't accept them for free.

18:48.510 --> 18:49.700
What can I do for you?

18:57.830 --> 18:59.570
My days are numbered.

19:01.880 --> 19:03.380
Can I ask you for a favor?

19:04.240 --> 19:04.980
My husband

19:06.480 --> 19:08.090
was killed by the Fu clan.

19:08.640 --> 19:09.810
He fled here

19:10.400 --> 19:12.250
and succumbed to his injuries.

19:13.070 --> 19:13.980
I hope

19:14.350 --> 19:15.530
you can

19:17.970 --> 19:19.630
avenge us

19:20.550 --> 19:22.250
on our behalf one day.

19:22.640 --> 19:24.660
The Fu Clan has poisoned the Yuanwu Kingdom long enough.

19:24.880 --> 19:26.860
[In Memory of Qi Yunxiao]
They rob and kill

19:27.200 --> 19:29.730
as if it's no different from breathing.

19:34.790 --> 19:35.660
I know

19:36.440 --> 19:37.660
it is a huge favor to ask.

19:39.720 --> 19:41.460
But I have no other options.

19:43.440 --> 19:44.420
Get up now.

20:03.350 --> 20:04.090
I can

20:04.830 --> 20:06.860
give you my promise.

20:07.550 --> 20:08.900
When I'm strong enough,

20:09.510 --> 20:10.140
I

20:10.680 --> 20:11.620
will bring justice to you.

20:13.310 --> 20:14.460
Please accept my bow,

20:15.000 --> 20:16.290
Senior.

20:24.440 --> 20:25.180
Miss Ruyin.

20:25.790 --> 20:26.660
I have done

20:27.270 --> 20:28.900
some research on your ailment

20:29.440 --> 20:30.290
and found some recipes too.

20:31.550 --> 20:32.620
While they might not cure you,

20:32.920 --> 20:34.010
they can alleviate

20:34.400 --> 20:35.380
your suffering

20:35.750 --> 20:36.460
more or less.

20:38.400 --> 20:39.090
I

20:39.310 --> 20:40.770
will stay here for a few days

20:41.550 --> 20:42.330
to make pills

20:42.510 --> 20:43.460
for you.

20:43.790 --> 20:45.250
Thank you so much, Senior.

20:46.640 --> 20:47.620
Please

20:47.920 --> 20:49.700
don't mind my humble abode.

20:50.510 --> 20:51.220
Once

20:51.310 --> 20:52.730
I'm done with the teleport array,

20:53.030 --> 20:54.140
you will have it.

20:55.440 --> 20:56.420
Thank you.

22:00.590 --> 22:01.290
Master,

22:02.510 --> 22:03.530
I

22:04.000 --> 22:05.250
might not understand it now,

22:06.270 --> 22:07.770
but I don't regret giving her my promise.

22:09.440 --> 22:10.460
But I can only deliver my promise

22:11.070 --> 22:13.140
once I reach the Core Formation Stage.

22:14.480 --> 22:15.460
Being weak

22:15.750 --> 22:16.660
and brash

22:17.550 --> 22:19.460
will only kill me.

22:30.100 --> 22:32.300
[Three Days Later]

23:03.750 --> 23:04.730
Senior Han,

23:05.440 --> 23:07.010
unbeknownst to you and my husband,

23:07.550 --> 23:09.660
the difficulty in repairing ancient arrays

23:10.070 --> 23:11.250
does not lie in technicality,

23:11.920 --> 23:15.090
but that it requires the vitality of array masters.

23:16.240 --> 23:17.860
Do not feel guilty.

23:18.790 --> 23:20.770
[Serenity and Peace]
Given my impending demise,

23:21.160 --> 23:22.420
to sacrifice myself for an array

23:22.720 --> 23:23.860
is an honor.

23:25.000 --> 23:25.730
Lastly,

23:26.110 --> 23:27.380
if my passing

23:27.790 --> 23:29.730
makes you honor your promise,

23:30.240 --> 23:31.010
then it's worth it.

23:32.160 --> 23:35.250
My husband built this hut himself.

23:35.750 --> 23:37.490
It is my home.

23:38.480 --> 23:40.220
If it's not too much trouble,

23:40.590 --> 23:41.810
please

23:42.350 --> 23:44.860
bury me next to my husband behind the mountain.

23:45.900 --> 23:48.960
[In Memory of Xin Ruyin, In Memory of Qi Yunxiao]

23:48.960 --> 23:49.900
Senior Han,

23:50.480 --> 23:52.940
the ancient array is indeed a mystical one.

23:53.750 --> 23:55.290
It took

23:55.720 --> 23:57.290
all of me

23:57.550 --> 23:59.010
to repair the array slightly.

24:00.070 --> 24:02.250
Place it on the stone tablet.

24:02.790 --> 24:04.460
Gather the missing ingredients

24:04.960 --> 24:06.900
and the Greater Teleport Command Seal.

24:07.510 --> 24:09.090
You may then activate the array.

24:10.070 --> 24:11.330
You will move a thousand li

24:11.590 --> 24:12.810
in an instant.

24:14.200 --> 24:16.380
Alas, the ancient array

24:16.550 --> 24:17.810
is barely recorded in any scrolls.

24:18.310 --> 24:21.140
I can't identify the destination.

24:22.480 --> 24:23.570
But given

24:23.830 --> 24:25.290
your good luck,

24:25.590 --> 24:27.180
you will be safe.

24:28.270 --> 24:30.250
I suppose this is the end

24:30.720 --> 24:32.090
for array masters

24:32.350 --> 24:33.460
like me.

24:34.680 --> 24:35.530
But I am content

24:36.110 --> 24:37.730
to have found a spot in my life.

24:38.310 --> 24:39.380
Please

24:39.590 --> 24:40.940
take care

24:41.590 --> 24:43.010
and honor your promise.

24:44.030 --> 24:44.810
Regards,

24:45.070 --> 24:45.770
Ruyin.

25:22.160 --> 25:23.180
The security isn't tight.

25:23.830 --> 25:24.900
It seems like they

25:25.200 --> 25:26.050
have not found out about the array.

25:35.720 --> 25:36.620
He won't give up.

25:36.680 --> 25:37.460
How annoying.

25:41.880 --> 25:42.570
Nangong Wan?

25:43.310 --> 25:44.250
What is she doing here?

27:38.510 --> 27:40.220
Senior Nangong of the Moonshadow Sect?

27:49.240 --> 27:51.090
You still stand

27:51.750 --> 27:53.140
despite your injury.

27:54.550 --> 27:56.770
As expected of a veteran from the Moonshadow Sect.

27:57.640 --> 27:58.460
Him again.

27:59.030 --> 28:00.460
He's everywhere.

28:05.160 --> 28:06.090
I suppose

28:06.750 --> 28:09.380
you are behind all the escaped

28:11.480 --> 28:13.730
captives lately, then.

28:15.720 --> 28:16.570
Young man,

28:17.160 --> 28:18.620
you keep chasing me.

28:18.830 --> 28:19.900
Do you have a death wish?

28:22.880 --> 28:23.980
My apologies.

28:24.720 --> 28:26.220
I wouldn't provoke you

28:26.550 --> 28:27.980
if we were anywhere else.

28:29.350 --> 28:30.900
But you're now

28:31.480 --> 28:33.730
at the heart of the Ghost Spirit Sect.

28:35.350 --> 28:37.180
Can I help you?

28:38.960 --> 28:40.810
Let's have some tea together.

28:41.960 --> 28:43.010
I must

28:44.000 --> 28:45.940
be a good host.

28:46.920 --> 28:48.770
All this because I'm looking for

28:49.270 --> 28:50.010
that stupid Han Li.

28:50.440 --> 28:51.980
Why did he return to the Yan Clan Stronghold?

28:53.110 --> 28:54.010
I don't have

28:54.160 --> 28:54.810
the interest, the mood,

28:54.880 --> 28:55.700
or the time.

28:56.510 --> 28:57.380
Go away

28:57.550 --> 28:58.460
if you want to live.

29:00.160 --> 29:02.290
But you're injured.

29:04.440 --> 29:05.460
Elder Gui, Elder Tong.

29:06.310 --> 29:07.250
Didn't you say

29:07.270 --> 29:08.980
you want to swear loyalty to me again?

29:12.070 --> 29:14.420
Show me your devotion.

29:18.590 --> 29:19.860
Of course.

30:18.160 --> 30:18.940
Bring our people

30:19.440 --> 30:21.140
across the forest in front of us

30:21.720 --> 30:23.660
and cut off her retreat

30:24.240 --> 30:25.570
by sieging her from the cliff behind.

30:52.510 --> 30:53.050
Oh, no.

30:53.920 --> 30:55.250
I'm so close

30:55.790 --> 30:56.940
yet this is happening.

30:58.720 --> 30:59.220
Whatever.

31:29.720 --> 31:31.180
Lay in ambush here.

31:32.830 --> 31:33.570
Yes!

31:49.880 --> 31:50.810
It's her.

31:51.790 --> 31:52.900
I think she is hurt.

31:54.480 --> 31:55.290
Dong Xuan'er?

31:56.310 --> 31:57.330
Why is she here?

31:58.720 --> 32:00.290
Did she join the demonic sects?

32:02.880 --> 32:04.090
And this guy from the Ghost Spirit Sect

32:04.110 --> 32:04.980
who won't leave us alone.

32:05.240 --> 32:07.140
Who knew a Core Formation Stage cultivator

32:07.160 --> 32:08.180
could run with her tail

32:08.200 --> 32:10.180
between her legs?

32:11.030 --> 32:11.770
Senior,

32:12.310 --> 32:13.490
isn't it shameful to flee

32:14.070 --> 32:15.290
without putting up a fight?

32:16.000 --> 32:17.570
Not as shameful as ganging up on others

32:18.110 --> 32:20.050
and conquering other lands.

32:23.000 --> 32:24.010
You two,

32:24.510 --> 32:25.330
what are you waiting for?

32:27.000 --> 32:27.620
Young Lady!

32:29.640 --> 32:30.570
I am Dong Xuan'er,

32:30.590 --> 32:31.900
a disciple of Hongfu under Yellow Maple Valley.

32:32.110 --> 32:33.010
Greetings.

32:34.070 --> 32:34.900
Dong Xuan'er.

32:35.350 --> 32:37.140
Why are you consorting with the demonic sects?

32:38.030 --> 32:39.090
It's a long story.

32:39.440 --> 32:41.380
Please come with us

32:41.590 --> 32:43.330
and clear up this misunderstanding.

32:43.830 --> 32:45.860
Your sect is negotiating peace with the Six Demonic Sects.

32:46.400 --> 32:48.090
I can ensure your safety.

32:49.310 --> 32:50.420
That peace talk

32:50.790 --> 32:52.730
is just one's wishful thinking.

32:53.720 --> 32:54.810
The righteous and evil are sworn enemies.

32:55.510 --> 32:57.900
The demonic cults sow chaos for their selfish desires.

32:58.750 --> 32:59.860
I hate fighting,

33:00.200 --> 33:01.660
yet I must avenge

33:02.070 --> 33:02.900
my friends.

33:03.920 --> 33:04.620
Let's

33:05.160 --> 33:06.380
settle the score today.

33:07.480 --> 33:08.180
Senior,

33:08.920 --> 33:10.860
your life-bound treasure is damaged.

33:12.270 --> 33:13.810
This sword technique is powerful,

33:14.510 --> 33:15.700
but it consumes your cultivation core.

33:17.270 --> 33:18.220
Look.

33:18.880 --> 33:20.010
There are so many of us.

33:21.440 --> 33:22.420
Can you win?

33:27.400 --> 33:28.050
Now's the time.

33:31.590 --> 33:32.050
Don't!

33:32.200 --> 33:32.810
Don't come near me.

33:33.640 --> 33:34.420
It's him.

33:34.920 --> 33:35.980
Why is he here?

33:37.550 --> 33:38.250
Wait.

33:38.590 --> 33:40.330
Let's talk it out.

33:40.550 --> 33:41.380
Don't move.

33:42.000 --> 33:43.660
Impressive.

33:45.000 --> 33:46.380
You snuck

33:46.510 --> 33:48.460
into my incompetent team quietly.

33:50.240 --> 33:50.810
Senior,

33:51.550 --> 33:52.660
he and I have a history.

33:53.070 --> 33:53.730
I can't show my face.

33:54.400 --> 33:55.660
Please deal with him.

33:56.270 --> 33:57.180
It's him?

33:57.440 --> 33:58.330
Why is he here?

33:59.200 --> 34:01.050
No, I can't let him know I'm here for him.

34:01.510 --> 34:01.940
It's...

34:02.110 --> 34:03.010
It's too embarrassing.

34:06.590 --> 34:07.860
Make way for me!

34:11.920 --> 34:12.660
Don't kill me.

34:12.790 --> 34:13.490
Don't kill me.

34:13.960 --> 34:14.420
You there!

34:14.590 --> 34:15.530
Let go of Young Lady.

34:16.510 --> 34:17.220
Listen to me.

34:17.550 --> 34:18.140
Do not move an inch!

34:19.270 --> 34:19.980
Silence.

34:22.350 --> 34:23.530
This is weird, Xuan'er.

34:23.920 --> 34:25.770
You've always avoided the remnants

34:25.790 --> 34:28.010
of the Seven Sects.

34:28.440 --> 34:30.810
Why are you so eager to intervene today?

34:32.070 --> 34:32.980
Unless

34:34.510 --> 34:36.290
you want to be held hostage by him?

34:37.000 --> 34:37.570
Wang Chan!

34:37.720 --> 34:38.530
Shut your mouth!

34:39.270 --> 34:40.730
Wise words, Young Master.

34:40.960 --> 34:42.570
We were almost fooled by her.

34:43.310 --> 34:44.530
Indeed!

34:45.160 --> 34:46.010
We split up later.

34:46.550 --> 34:47.330
He's a cunning foe.

34:47.590 --> 34:48.220
It won't be easy to fight him.

34:48.790 --> 34:50.250
Their target is you.

34:50.590 --> 34:51.570
You should go first.

34:52.200 --> 34:53.250
I have Dong Xuan'er.

34:53.680 --> 34:54.570
They won't do anything to me.

34:56.720 --> 34:57.220
All right.

34:58.750 --> 34:59.730
Enough of this farce.

35:00.000 --> 35:02.180
I don't care if you're doing this on purpose.

35:02.880 --> 35:03.980
Capture them both

35:04.000 --> 35:05.050
and we'll know.

35:06.400 --> 35:07.010
Senior,

35:07.680 --> 35:08.490
and this

35:10.030 --> 35:11.090
masked friend,

35:12.000 --> 35:12.620
just

35:14.070 --> 35:14.770
give up already.

35:15.510 --> 35:16.810
A Foundation Establishment cultivator cannot burrow underground.

35:17.200 --> 35:18.620
Can you escape?

35:19.790 --> 35:20.570
Forgive me.

35:22.030 --> 35:22.660
Take them down.

35:34.240 --> 35:35.090
I'll be waiting for you

35:35.310 --> 35:36.050
a hundred li to the west.

35:36.480 --> 35:37.380
Don't come with pursuers.

35:47.110 --> 35:48.260
I hate this.

35:49.510 --> 35:50.980
The easy prey

35:51.150 --> 35:52.170
escaped.

35:53.510 --> 35:54.820
Search everywhere

35:55.280 --> 35:56.300
within a 100-li radius!

35:56.800 --> 35:57.820
Yes, Young Master!

36:06.280 --> 36:06.900
Han Li.

36:07.800 --> 36:08.740
It's you, right?

36:10.670 --> 36:11.690
You're hurting me.

36:12.400 --> 36:14.130
Can you put it away?

36:16.190 --> 36:16.900
I'm sorry.

36:19.190 --> 36:20.460
It really is you.

36:25.230 --> 36:26.340
Han Li.

36:26.760 --> 36:28.300
You never told us you're safe

36:28.320 --> 36:29.420
after you escaped from the Yan Clan Stronghold.

36:30.190 --> 36:30.940
Don't you know I...

36:32.230 --> 36:34.130
and your master are worried about you?

36:36.510 --> 36:37.490
Forgive my recklessness

36:38.150 --> 36:38.820
just now.

36:41.770 --> 36:43.130
You're so courteous.

36:49.230 --> 36:50.570
I heard you were kidnapped.

36:52.480 --> 36:53.170
It seems like

36:54.030 --> 36:55.210
you've joined the Joyful Union Sect.

36:56.110 --> 36:57.610
Grandmaster Yunlu of Joyful Union Sect

36:58.230 --> 36:59.090
is my father.

37:01.800 --> 37:02.740
My master

37:02.960 --> 37:04.010
is my mother.

37:07.960 --> 37:09.900
She had a history with him.

37:10.320 --> 37:12.570
She didn't know who he truly was when they met.

37:13.960 --> 37:15.780
When she found out,

37:16.320 --> 37:17.860
she was already deeply in love

37:18.760 --> 37:19.820
and pregnant with me.

37:22.400 --> 37:23.690
That was why Wang Chan was after you

37:24.440 --> 37:25.610
when he first met you.

37:27.630 --> 37:28.650
Your gift of enchantment

37:29.550 --> 37:30.690
must have come from your father.

37:34.510 --> 37:35.260
Father

37:35.510 --> 37:36.300
took me in

37:36.320 --> 37:37.300
as his disciple.

37:38.670 --> 37:40.170
He even forcefully erased

37:40.280 --> 37:41.980
whatever I learned in Yellow Maple Valley.

37:43.150 --> 37:45.420
But since training under him,

37:45.760 --> 37:47.130
I've progressed very quickly.

37:47.800 --> 37:48.980
Can you imagine a Nascent Soul cultivator

37:49.000 --> 37:50.900
teaching you everything he knows?

37:52.190 --> 37:54.010
Not many can turn down

37:54.150 --> 37:55.420
an opportunity like that.

37:56.960 --> 37:57.820
Do you understand?

37:59.000 --> 38:00.610
But you're not like them.

38:01.230 --> 38:02.050
You won't

38:02.480 --> 38:04.260
ever be one of them.

38:05.280 --> 38:06.260
But I was told

38:06.510 --> 38:08.170
that once I mastered my technique,

38:08.550 --> 38:10.130
my personality would change too.

38:10.670 --> 38:11.740
When that happens,

38:13.110 --> 38:14.980
I might not even remember what you look like.

38:17.280 --> 38:18.420
A cultivator

38:19.000 --> 38:20.130
lives longer than a mortal.

38:21.400 --> 38:22.170
You will

38:22.510 --> 38:23.650
meet more people,

38:24.360 --> 38:25.420
and forget more people.

38:25.920 --> 38:26.690
But this doesn't matter.

38:27.590 --> 38:28.460
What matters

38:29.400 --> 38:30.690
is that you don't forget who you are.

38:34.400 --> 38:35.050
All right.

38:48.710 --> 38:49.490
I am Han Li.

38:49.920 --> 38:51.380
How may I address you?

38:51.630 --> 38:52.650
I am Dong Xuan'er.

38:52.880 --> 38:54.610
We're now friends.

38:57.150 --> 38:57.860
Han.

38:59.010 --> 39:00.020
You're also here?

39:19.400 --> 39:20.090
Master,

39:21.150 --> 39:22.090
Father,

39:23.070 --> 39:23.820
sorry.

39:24.840 --> 39:25.690
I still

39:26.480 --> 39:28.050
can't let go of him.

39:36.190 --> 39:36.980
Senior Han,

39:37.440 --> 39:38.780
just drop me here.

39:51.230 --> 39:51.780
All right.

39:51.920 --> 39:52.610
Go.

39:53.070 --> 39:53.860
I'll explain

39:53.880 --> 39:55.050
to my father.

39:55.440 --> 39:56.820
I'll buy you and Senior Nangong

39:56.840 --> 39:58.050
some time.

39:58.800 --> 40:00.610
Don't get caught by Wang Chan again.

40:00.800 --> 40:02.570
What exactly did you do to him

40:02.590 --> 40:03.650
in the Yan Clan Stronghold

40:03.880 --> 40:05.490
to make him so obsessed with you?

40:09.480 --> 40:10.130
Dong Xuan'er.

40:11.000 --> 40:11.690
Take care.

40:12.400 --> 40:13.010
Take care.

40:25.670 --> 40:26.610
Senior Han.

40:27.760 --> 40:28.490
Farewell.

40:29.550 --> 40:30.130
Mother,

40:30.960 --> 40:31.820
Mentor Li,

40:32.630 --> 40:34.260
and everyone in Yellow Maple Valley.

40:35.960 --> 40:37.010
Don't worry.

40:38.110 --> 40:39.090
I

40:39.630 --> 40:41.260
will walk my own path.

40:42.320 --> 40:44.260
I won't be swayed by anyone.

40:46.230 --> 40:46.940
Farewell.

40:56.840 --> 40:57.860
A hundred li to the west.

40:58.590 --> 40:59.650
This should be the place.

42:49.230 --> 42:50.260
She's seriously injured.

42:51.000 --> 42:51.740
I'm here.

42:52.320 --> 42:53.300
I won't let you die.

43:12.100 --> 43:17.420
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:18.660 --> 43:24.060
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:24.180 --> 43:27.380
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:27.620 --> 43:29.860
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:30.260 --> 43:33.100
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:33.620 --> 43:37.580
♪Easier just to miss♪

43:38.420 --> 43:43.900
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

43:45.060 --> 43:50.340
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

43:50.940 --> 43:53.980
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

43:54.260 --> 43:56.380
♪Swept away by time♪

43:57.020 --> 43:59.660
♪Eyes once looked far♪

44:00.140 --> 44:04.100
♪Now lost in the shift♪

44:04.580 --> 44:07.420
♪Autumn winds stir♪

44:07.700 --> 44:09.620
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:10.060 --> 44:12.500
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:12.820 --> 44:16.340
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:16.900 --> 44:19.860
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:20.180 --> 44:23.100
♪Time lost its name♪

44:23.500 --> 44:26.340
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:26.740 --> 44:30.300
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:30.660 --> 44:33.500
♪The world has changed♪

44:33.900 --> 44:35.740
♪Beyond recall♪

44:36.300 --> 44:38.020
♪Time will fade♪

44:38.420 --> 44:43.220
♪All the words ever spoken♪

44:43.900 --> 44:46.780
♪Only this longing remains♪

44:47.260 --> 44:52.540
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

44:53.660 --> 45:00.300
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

45:00.780 --> 45:10.500
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
